WEBVTT

00:04:28.125 --> 00:04:30.460
and we're having small chat.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:33.279
I don't even remember 
cooking dinner that night.

00:04:33.279 --> 00:04:39.646
But then our leader, Pete, set the vision,

00:04:39.646 --> 00:04:42.802
and talked to us just like 
we were his new team.

00:04:42.802 --> 00:04:46.493
He said, "There will be 
no wallowing, people."

00:04:46.493 --> 00:04:48.814
He goes, "We're not looking back,

00:04:48.814 --> 00:04:50.869
we're looking forward.

00:04:50.869 --> 00:04:56.623
What an amazing opportunity 
we have to change the world.

00:04:56.623 --> 00:04:58.958
I'm going to change the face

00:04:58.958 --> 00:05:02.111
of this unacceptable situation of ALS.